{"ref":"BDB, מְחוֹלָה","hw":"מְחוֹלָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מְחוֹלָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. id.</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחֹלַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:1\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.1\">Ct 7:1</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחֹלֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:19\" href=\"/Exodus.32.19\">Ex 32:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחֹלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:20\" href=\"/Exodus.15.20\">Ex 15:20</a> + 5 times; <em>dancing</em>, token of joyousness after victory, <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:34\" href=\"/Judges.11.34\">Ju 11:34</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.6\">1 S 18:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.12\">21:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 29:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.29.5\">29:5</a>; in worship, at feast <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:21\" href=\"/Judges.21.21\">Ju 21:21</a>; act of praise to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:20\" href=\"/Exodus.15.20\">Ex 15:20</a> (song); in idolatrous worship <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:19\" href=\"/Exodus.32.19\">Ex 32:19</a> (E); as graceful and beautiful <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:1\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.1\">Ct 7:1</a>; accomp. by timbrel <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:20\" href=\"/Exodus.15.20\">Ex 15:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:34\" href=\"/Judges.11.34\">Ju 11:34</a>, and by singing <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:20\" href=\"/Exodus.15.20\">Ex 15:20</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.6\">1 S 18:6</a> (where however read prob. Poʿlel Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְּחֹלְלוֹת</span>, cf. vb. <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּל</span> supr.; so 𝔊 We Dr), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.12\">21:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 29:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.29.5\">29:5</a>.","next":"BDB, חול","prev":"BDB, מָחוֹל"}